# SS-14 - Investigate exchange files and free public data routes
Workstream ID: SS-14
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/14
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M2
Dependencies: SS-03

## Purpose
Improve authoritative provenance and assess sustainable free daily-data options.

## Tasks
- [ ] NSE: current bhavcopy/UDiFF, archives, ISIN/symbol history and corporate-action files.
- [ ] BSE: current bhavcopy/history formats, scrip mapping and corporate-action files.
- [ ] Yahoo/yfinance: personal-use terms, throttling, revisions, adjustment semantics and gaps.
- [ ] Google Finance: record restrictions; investigate only an officially permitted API route.
- [ ] Community wrappers/mirrors: nsepython, jugaad-data and public datasets; trace upstream rights.
- [ ] Define permitted CSV/file ingestion, reconciliation and source-version retention.
- [ ] Complete common qualification per viable route; no blocked-site bypass or fallback fabrication.

## Acceptance criteria
- Downloadability is not treated as redistribution permission.
- Unavailable official pages/schemas remain unverified until actual primary evidence is obtained.

## Completion evidence
- Yahoo project documentation and Google restrictions read.
- NSE pages timed out and BSE page failed retrieval; no exchange-file integration claimed.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Recorded free-route findings and explicit authoritative-data gaps.
